<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2>Attendance Regularization Request</h2>
  <p>Dear {{approverName}},</p>

  <p>{{employeeName}} has requested a regularization for the following attendance details:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{shiftDay}}</li>
    <li><strong>Requested In Time:</strong> {{fromTime}}</li>
    <li><strong>Requested Out Time:</strong> {{toTime}}</li>
    <li><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Please review the request in the Zuno HR portal.</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
    <a href="{{reviewLink}}" style="background-color: #4a90e2; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">Review Request</a>
  </div>

  <p>Regards,</p>
  <p>{{companyName}} Zuno HR</p>
</div>
